From f94be9f31fd7344c3bff4173006ca42d8db34acf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brendan Juno <brendan@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:55:57 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Share quest accept and turn-in with nearby grouped bots

When a real player in a group accepts a quest, grouped bots within 40
yards take it too if they can (CanTakeQuest and CanAddQuest). When that
player turns a quest in, bots that also have it complete hand it in,
receive the XP and gold, and pick the reward with the existing
PickRewardIndex scoring (ScoreItemForBot). CanRewardQuest is required,
so a bot missing item objectives or bag space is skipped rather than
force-completed. Bot-initiated accept and turn-in do not recurse.
New keys, both default on: CoaBots.Quest.ShareTurnIn and ShareAccept.
