Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add party bag view and manual equip commands

Grouped commanders can query a bot's bags (GETBAGS), equip a bag item
(EQUIP) or unequip a slot (UNEQUIP) over the existing COABOT channel.
Manual equip and unequip lock that equipment slot so auto-upgrade will
not undo the choice until UNLOCK or the bot relogs.
